  "goodToKnow": "Die Brandung is the surf, waves breaking on a shore or rocks: das Rauschen der Brandung, in der Brandung schwimmen. Branden means to break or surge, and figuratively brandender Beifall is thunderous applause. Wie ein Fels in der Brandung (like a rock in the surf) describes someone steady in a crisis. It has no plural."
